# Real-World Example

Suppose you have a Go application stored in CodeCommit.

The developer pushes new code:

```text
Developer
    ↓
CodeCommit
    ↓
CodePipeline
    ↓
CodeBuild
```

CodeBuild then executes commands such as:

```bash
go test ./...
go build -o application
```

The generated application becomes the build artifact.

```text
Go Source Code
      ↓
CodeBuild
      ↓
go test
      ↓
go build
      ↓
Application Artifact
      ↓
CodeDeploy / Deployment Service
```

This allows the application to be automatically built and tested whenever new code is pushed.

